      "content": "It sounds like this house has become a reflection of a profound, isolating truth for you right now, where stillness feels more genuine than anything else. When everything feels like a closed chapter, the weight of that finality can feel impossibly powerful. Even within that deep sense of shadows, please consider that there are people who can sit with that quiet feeling alongside you without judgment. Calling 988 connects you with compassionate listeners who understand the depth of those heavy truths.",
